    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Bright Corner Apartment with Two Private Balconies.\r\n\r\nPresented in excellent condition throughout, No. 2 Glenbrook View is a spacious and light-filled corner apartment ideally situated within this popular residential development. Benefiting from an end position, the property enjoys added privacy, an abundance of natural light, and the rare advantage of two private balconies, one accessed from the living room and a second from the main bedroom.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation is thoughtfully laid out and offers comfortable modern living with generous room proportions, ample storage, and designated parking. Located within walking distance of local amenities, schools, shops, and transport links, this property is perfectly suited to first-time buyers, downsizers, or investors alike.\r\n\r\nAccommodation\r\nEntrance Hallway\r\nApprox. 7ft x 4ft\r\nTiled flooring\r\nApprox. 8.5ft ceiling height\r\n\r\nLiving Room\r\nApprox. 14ft x 16ft\r\nBright and spacious open-plan living area\r\nApprox. 9ft ceiling height\r\nAccess to private balcony (approx. 14ft long)\r\n\r\nKitchen\r\nApprox. 8ft x 9ft\r\nTiled flooring\r\nGas cooker\r\nElectric oven\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom\r\nApprox. 9ft x 15ft\r\nBuilt-in wardrobe\r\nDirect access to private balcony\r\nEn-Suite\r\nApprox. 7ft x 3ft\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\nApprox. 10ft x 7ft\r\nDouble bedroom currently used as a children’s room\r\nWood flooring\r\nBuilt-in wardrobe\r\nLarge window providing excellent natural light\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom\r\nApprox. 7ft 1in x 5ft 7in\r\nBath/shower\r\nGas-heated hot water\r\nStorage Room\r\nApprox. 3ft x 2ft\r\n\r\nHot Press\r\nApprox. 2ft x 8ft"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Key Features\r\nCorner apartment position offering additional privacy\r\nTwo private balconies\r\nBalcony off living room (approx. 14ft long)\r\nPrivate balcony off main bedroom\r\nSpacious living room with 9ft ceilings\r\nBuilt-in wardrobes in both bedrooms\r\nGas heating\r\nExcellent storage including hot press and store room\r\nDesignated parking space\r\nAllocated parking available\r\nWalking distance to village amenities\r\nEasy access to Dublin, Greystones, and Wicklow Town\r\nThis attractive apartment combines bright, spacious accommodation with a highly convenient location and unique outdoor space, making it a fantastic opportunity for buyers seeking comfort, convenience, and value in the heart of Newtownmountkennedy."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: B3"
      }
